  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000pjlq](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000pjlq) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 545.318 depth occurred on Jan 13 2025 17km NW of Kalamansig. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 6.6157 longitude 123.9082. It impacted 176017 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
